*.pyc

# Build-time only. Lora and Inter, from github.com/google/fonts, used by
# images.py to draw assets/og.jpg. The card itself is committed, so nobody
# needs these unless they are regenerating it; without them images.py falls
# back to Georgia, which is this site's own declared serif fallback.
_build/_fonts/
_build/_stock/
